Added the REST API: `GET /health`, device sync and lists, and runs that stop at `AWAITING_APPROVAL`. Start it with `uvicorn --factory hco_core.api.app:app_from_env`.
Added the `X-HCO-Actor` header. A request that changes data needs it in Phase 1, and any client can send any name.
Added RFC 9457 problem documents for each API error, such as a 404 that names the unknown device.
